<h2 data-section-id=3D"kk8pdu" data-start=3D"491" data-end=3D"532">1) Was d=
ie Anwendung aktuell schon ist</h2>
<p data-start=3D"534" data-end=3D"606">Architektonisch ist das eine klassis=
che FastAPI- + React/Vite-Anwendung.</p>
<p data-start=3D"608" data-end=3D"1209">Im Backend sind u. a. bereits Route=
r f=C3=BCr Auth, Admin, Audit, Search, Portfolios, Properties, Units, Tenan=
ts, Contracts, Accounts, Bookings, Receivables, Invoices, Maintenance, Docu=
ments, Tasks, Calendar, Listings, Categories, Leads, Viewings, Billing, Dep=
